# Implicit rescue, else and ensure in each body that takes them without begin: a def, a fun, a do-block and a do proc
# literal (hosted parser.cr 5400, 7959, 6488 and 3430). Nine forms in each body: rescue alone, rescue with a type, with a
# variable, with a variable and a type, with several types, with several clauses, with else, ensure alone, and all three.

